---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Quality & Durability Standards | Satvastones Anti-Tarnish Jewellery"
  description="Transparent quality & anti-tarnish durability standards for Satvastones Jewellery."
>
  <!-- Jewelsmars Clean Header -->
  <div class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100 py-8 sm:py-12">
    <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-1">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a1505a]">Integrity & Standards</span>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Quality & Durability Standards</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Honest, grounded craftsmanship without inflated marketing claims.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Honest Quality Statement -->
      <div class="bg-[#fffafb] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#f9d8dc] rounded-[22px] space-y-3">
        <span class="text-[10px] text-[#a1505a] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Uncompromising Truth</span>
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">1. An Honest Quality Statement</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          At Satvastones, we refuse to make misleading promises that our jewellery will "never ever lose its shine under any circumstance," because no metal surface subjected to daily abrasion, harsh detergents, or bleach can remain 100% immune to natural environmental wear.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          However, <strong>the quality and durability of our products are exceptionally high</strong>. By bonding real 18K gold to surgical-grade 316L stainless steel via vacuum Physical Vapor Deposition (PVD), our pieces provide vastly superior resistance to rust, sweat, water, and discoloration compared to standard brass or alloy jewellery.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: Material Specifications -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-200 rounded-[22px] space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">2. Craftsmanship Specifications</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li><strong>Substrate:</strong> 316L Surgical-Grade Stainless Steel (100% hypoallergenic, nickel-free, lead-free).</li>
          <li><strong>Gold Coating:</strong> Genuine 18K Gold applied via high-vacuum PVD technology.</li>
          <li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> Suitable for daily showers, workouts, and sweat.</li>
          <li><strong>Dispatch Verification:</strong> Hand-inspected and dispatched from our Vapi store location in 24–48 hours.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Replacement Coverage -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-200 rounded-[22px] space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">3. Replacement Guidelines for Damaged Pieces</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          We do not offer cash refunds. In the rare event that your jewellery arrives damaged due to courier mishandling during transit, we provide an immediate free replacement upon receiving an <strong>unedited 360-degree unboxing video proof</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
          For warranty inquiries, contact our customer team at <a href="mailto:support@satvastones.in" class="text-[#f2707f] font-bold underline">support@satvastones.in</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
